WEBVTT

00:00:58.142 --> 00:01:02.243
and we'd traveled
to this huge international meeting

00:01:02.267 --> 00:01:04.159
about environment and development

00:01:04.183 --> 00:01:07.784
to tell the adults
they had to change their ways.

00:01:07.808 --> 00:01:11.493
That same year 1,700 scientists

00:01:11.517 --> 00:01:15.534
would issue the World Scientists'
Warning to Humanity

00:01:15.558 --> 00:01:19.034
to tell us that humans
and the natural world

00:01:19.058 --> 00:01:21.659
were on a collision course.

00:01:21.683 --> 00:01:24.826
Much like Greta Thunberg
and her peers today,

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:30.118
we believed that decision-makers
should be acting on science and facts.